# Save the Clock Tower (jeuno 3): Derrick in Lower Jeuno and the ten who sign the petition (Pitantimand in Port
# Jeuno; Teigero-Bangero and Zauko in Lower Jeuno; Baudin, Collet, Constance, Monberaux, Souren and Zuber in Upper
# Jeuno; Radeivepart in Ru'Lude Gardens). The guard (A Clock Most Delicate completed, Jeuno fame level 5), Collet's 164
# while offered, Derrick's 230 (8, 10) (option 0: nothing), then with the pass 230 (10, 10) (option 20 with a full bag:
# no petition, not begun; option 20: the petition, begun), Derrick's 230 (6, 10) while accepted (option 30 with the petition held: the rare give fails,
# Prog kept), the petition to Derrick with fewer than ten signatures (nil), a bone chip to a signer (nil), the ten
# signatures (each event's first argument is 9 minus the bits set: 9 down to 0; a second petition to a signer: nil),
# Souren's 120, the petition with ten signatures (231: completed, Clock Tower
# Preservationist, fame +17 x3, the petition taken), Derrick's own 230 (14) once completed, Souren's 181. The Airship
# Pass (a GM) comes after the first offer, so both offers (8 / 10) and the accepted 230 with it (6) are taken here;
# #new_petition takes the accepted 230 without it (4).
# Jeuno fame: 216/217/216 is 324 (level 4), 216/217/217 is 325 (level 5).
# Derrick's script (no quest acting): 230 (4294967293, 10) without the pass, 230 (14) with it; its update and finish
# act on option 10 (the airship pass sale) only. Collet's default 114, Souren's 88. The signers' other quests act on a
# trigger only (Northward's Radeivepart offer at fame level 4, Community Service's Zauko) or need what this char lacks
# (Monberaux's script: the Cardian quests and an SoA trust spell; Teigero-Bangero's script: the Cardian quests).
lists LowerJeuno/Derrick/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Derrick/onTrade UpperJeuno/Collet/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Souren/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Teigero-Bangero/onTrade LowerJeuno/Zauko/onTrade PortJeuno/Pitantimand/onTrade UpperJeuno/Baudin/onTrade UpperJeuno/Collet/onTrade UpperJeuno/Constance/onTrade UpperJeuno/Monberaux/onTrade UpperJeuno/Souren/onTrade UpperJeuno/Zuber/onTrade RuludeGardens/Radeivepart/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/230 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/231 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/50 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/74 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/64 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/91 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/115 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/126 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/177 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/180 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/182 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/160
warning: quests: jeuno.save_the_clock_tower: one finish of 230 ran 2 handlers (1/-/onEventFinish:230, 2/-/onEventFinish:230) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at Save_the_Clock_Tower.lua:71 (available) and :121 (accepted) at lua-at 9504b6d8 hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-32.4,-1,-6.1
fame Sandoria 216
fame Bastok 217
fame Windurst 216
item BoneChip
login
trigger Derrick                             # A Clock Most Delicate available: no section; his script's 230 (4294967293, 10)
finish
quest Jeuno.AClockMostDelicate completed    # a GM
trigger Derrick                             # Jeuno fame 324 (level 4): no section; his script's 230
finish
fame Windurst 217                           # Jeuno fame 325: level 5
warp -42.2,0,107 UpperJeuno
trigger Collet                              # available, guard met: 164
finish
trade Collet BoneChip x1                    # available: no trade handler; nothing
warp -32.4,-1,-6.1 LowerJeuno
trigger Derrick                             # available: 230 (8, 10)
finish option=0                             # not 20: nothing
trade Derrick BoneChip x1                   # available: no trade handler (nor in his script); nothing
keyitem AirshipPass                         # a GM
trigger Derrick                             # available, the pass: 230 (10, 10)
fill-inventory
finish option=20                            # no room: no petition, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Derrick                             # 230 (10, 10)
finish option=20                            # the Clock Tower Petition, begun
trigger Derrick                             # accepted, the pass: 230 (6, 10)
finish option=30                            # the petition held (rare): the give fails, Prog stays 0
trade Derrick ClockTowerPetition x1         # no signature: nil, nothing
walk -57.1,-0.1,-143.8
trade Teigero-Bangero BoneChip x1           # not the petition: nil, nothing
trade Teigero-Bangero ClockTowerPetition x1 # bit 1 clear: 74 (9)
finish                                      # bit 1
trade Teigero-Bangero ClockTowerPetition x1 # bit 1 set: nil, nothing
walk -2.4,0,14.2
trade Zauko ClockTowerPetition x1           # bit 2: 50 (8)
finish
trigger Derrick                             # accepted, the pass, two signatures (Prog 6): 230 (6, 10)
finish option=0                             # not 30: nothing given, Prog stays 6
warp -62.3,8,46.1 PortJeuno
trade Pitantimand ClockTowerPetition x1     # bit 0: 64 (7)
finish
warp -74.9,-1.2,80 UpperJeuno
trade Baudin ClockTowerPetition x1          # bit 3: 177 (6)
finish
walk -42.2,0,107
trade Collet ClockTowerPetition x1          # bit 4: 115 (5)
finish
walk -46.9,-0.5,5.9
trade Constance ClockTowerPetition x1       # bit 5: 180 (4)
finish
walk -40.9,-0.5,-1.9
trade Monberaux ClockTowerPetition x1       # bit 6: 91 (3)
finish
walk -51.7,-0.5,4.4
trigger Souren                              # accepted: 120
finish
trade Souren ClockTowerPetition x1          # bit 7: 182 (2)
finish
walk -104.2,-0.2,93.2
trade Zuber ClockTowerPetition x1           # bit 8: 126 (1)
finish
warp 5.9,9,-38.7 RuludeGardens
trade Radeivepart ClockTowerPetition x1     # bit 9: 160 (0)
finish                                      # ten bits (Prog 1023)
warp -32.4,-1,-6.1 LowerJeuno
trade Derrick ClockTowerPetition x1 BoneChip x1 # ten signatures, a chip too: tradeHasExactly fails, nil
trade Derrick ClockTowerPetition x1         # ten signatures: 231
finish                                      # completed: Clock Tower Preservationist, fame +17 x3, the petition taken
trigger Derrick                             # completed: no section; his script's 230 (14)
finish
warp -51.7,-0.5,4.4 UpperJeuno
trigger Souren                              # completed: 181 (replaceDefault)
finish
